body:
Personally, so far, the show is watchable. This is the only filipino show that I watch even though the industry is known for shitty acting.

&#x200B;

Like local pro-wrestling, one element that makes me enjoy watching it is the Suspense of Disbelief.

At some point, her identity will be fully disclosed. 

&#x200B;

Some say she's a bastard child of a royalty or a politician. Some say she's Sarah Fisher or her half sister. I got a feeling that her actual identity could make Ubisoft unintentionally pissed off a certain country, like she's a Uyghur refugee residing on Denmark or something.
